1
00:04:34,285 --> 00:04:40,285
In the Ghettos of Harlem you don't buy respect... you earn it.

2
00:09:08,571 --> 00:09:14,571
Juice is a crime, drama, thriller film directed by Ernest R. Dickerson.

3
00:13:42,857 --> 00:13:48,857
Four Harlem friends -- Bishop, Q, Steel and Raheem -- dabble in petty crime,
but they decide to go big by knocking off a convenience store.

4
00:18:17,142 --> 00:18:23,142
Bishop, the magnetic leader of the group, has the gun.

5
00:22:51,428 --> 00:22:57,428
But Q has different aspirations.

6
00:27:25,714 --> 00:27:31,714
He wants to be a DJ and happens to have a gig the night of the robbery.

7
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:06,000
Unfortunately for him, Bishop isn't willing to take no for
answer in a game where everything's for keeps.

8
00:36:34,285 --> 00:36:40,285
Quincy 'Q' Powell, played by Omar Epps.

9
